{"product_id":"ram","title":"Ram","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Chinese horoscope system is based on the specific date and time of an individual's birth. Each of these is associated with either Yin or Yang and have specific pairings with another of the animal signs. Add to this the legends of each animal sign and your lucky direction according to the Eight Trigrams, and you will realize how much is covered in the Chinese horoscope. Secrets of physical and behavioural characteristics, which years are auspicious for which signs and love recommendations with other animals are included. By the author of \"Authentic Chinese Horoscopes\" and \"The Fortune Teller's I Ching\".\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 0  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Man-Ho Kwok \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780751301236 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Hardcover \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44933303042201,"sku":"8RC9780751301236","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/4abc8cb3e8b4a68f990ace24c9b451b0.jpg?v=1730469871","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/ram","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}